00:06:16.876 --> 00:06:17.744
to protect him,

00:06:17.744 --> 00:06:18.444
even sometimes

00:06:18.444 --> 00:06:19.846
when he hasn't even asked them to do it,

00:06:19.846 --> 00:06:22.415
they understand what he wants them to do.

00:06:22.415 --> 00:06:23.783
I mean, you see all these people

00:06:23.783 --> 00:06:24.617
who are indicted,

00:06:24.617 --> 00:06:26.052
including his own chief of staff

00:06:26.052 --> 00:06:26.786
at the White House

00:06:26.786 --> 00:06:29.856
and in Georgia, we've seen Michael Cohen.

00:06:29.856 --> 00:06:32.492
We've seen Weisselberg previously.

00:06:32.492 --> 00:06:34.160
We it's just up

00:06:34.160 --> 00:06:38.598
Donald Trump is just a cloud of

00:06:38.664 --> 00:06:39.732
deception.

00:06:39.732 --> 00:06:43.102
And he is he creates a culture

00:06:43.102 --> 00:06:45.071
of lying and deception

00:06:45.071 --> 00:06:47.173
and illegality wherever he goes.

00:06:47.173 --> 00:06:49.175
And if you are associated with him,

00:06:49.175 --> 00:06:51.144
you have to be very, very careful.

00:06:51.144 --> 00:06:52.044
You're taking a risk.

00:06:52.044 --> 00:06:53.679
I mean, there are lawyers who

00:06:53.679 --> 00:06:55.948
who are losing their licenses,

00:06:55.948 --> 00:06:56.749
are threatening,

00:06:56.749 --> 00:06:57.483
