00:06:59.919 --> 00:07:00.787
And it just

00:07:00.787 --> 00:07:03.389
it never, ever stops with him.

00:07:03.389 --> 00:07:04.157
He asks

00:07:04.157 --> 00:07:06.058
he expects people to do

00:07:06.058 --> 00:07:07.193
illegal things for him.

00:07:07.193 --> 00:07:08.394
Here's what I'm confused by,

00:07:08.394 --> 00:07:09.429
which is Allen

00:07:09.429 --> 00:07:10.763
Weisselberg was in jail

00:07:10.763 --> 00:07:12.865
