00:08:08.688 --> 00:08:10.623
but we know that Trump's team

00:08:10.623 --> 00:08:13.059
is focused on slowing them down.

00:08:13.059 --> 00:08:14.560
Could could something like this

00:08:14.560 --> 00:08:16.496
strengthen his hand?

00:08:16.496 --> 00:08:18.764
Bragg's hand going into that trial?

00:08:18.764 --> 00:08:20.266
I think indirectly.

00:08:20.266 --> 00:08:22.969
I mean, this does not directly impact

00:08:22.969 --> 00:08:24.770
the charges that are involved in

00:08:24.770 --> 00:08:26.806
in the case that

00:08:26.873 --> 00:08:27.273
D.A.

00:08:27.273 --> 00:08:28.140
Bragg has brought.

00:08:28.140 --> 00:08:29.442
That's the it's actually

00:08:29.442 --> 00:08:31.277
the falsification of documents

00:08:31.277 --> 00:08:32.545
relating to the hush money

00:08:32.545 --> 00:08:33.646
that Donald Trump paid

00:08:33.646 --> 00:08:35.181
through Michael Cohen

00:08:35.181 --> 00:08:38.484
to Stormy Daniels, the porn star.

00:08:38.551 --> 00:08:40.386
So this doesn't directly relate to that.

00:08:40.386 --> 00:08:41.587
But I think it's a very,

00:08:41.587 --> 00:08:42.388
very important

00:08:42.388 --> 00:08:44.423
warning to any witness

00:08:44.423 --> 00:08:45.892
who's called to testify

00:08:45.892 --> 00:08:46.592
in that case

00:08:46.592 --> 00:08:48.094
on either side

00:08:48.094 --> 00:08:49.495
that they better not lie,

00:08:49.495 --> 00:08:50.963
because if they lie, then,

00:08:50.963 --> 00:08:51.264
you know,

00:08:51.264 --> 00:08:53.332
they could end up like right weisselberg

00:08:53.332 --> 00:08:54.600
at Rikers or someplace

00:08:54.600 --> 00:08:55.902
unpleasant like that.

00:08:55.902 --> 00:08:57.904
Yeah, it's a remarkable development

00:08:57.904 --> 00:08:58.704
in this story.

00:08:58.704 --> 00:09:00.573
George Conway, thank you for that.

00:09:00.573 --> 00:09:02.341
I mean, as we just

00:09:02.341 --> 00:09:02.909
we don't know what's

00:09:02.909 --> 00:09:03.943
going to happen here with this

00:09:03.943 --> 00:09:05.244
and whether or not he's taking it.

00:09:05.244 --> 00:09:07.213
But but big picture, how do you see it?

00:09:07.213 --> 00:09:07.313
Well,

00:09:07.313 --> 00:09:08.514
I think George makes a good point there.

00:09:08.514 --> 00:09:10.917
I think that this actually will

00:09:10.917 --> 00:09:12.151
tie Trump's hands a bit

00:09:12.151 --> 00:09:14.587
at the Manhattan DA's trial,

00:09:14.587 --> 00:09:16.155
because if they were planning

00:09:16.155 --> 00:09:17.523
on calling Allen Weisselberg

00:09:17.523 --> 00:09:18.925
to say, for example,

00:09:18.925 --> 00:09:19.458
Donald Trump

00:09:19.458 --> 00:09:20.560
had nothing to do with the way

00:09:20.560 --> 00:09:21.894
these hush money payments were logged,

00:09:21.894 --> 00:09:23.296
it was me, the CFO,

00:09:23.296 --> 00:09:24.297
and it was Michael Cohen,

00:09:24.297 --> 00:09:25.231
their star witness.

00:09:25.231 --> 00:09:26.165
He can't do that now.

00:09:26.165 --> 00:09:27.233
He's neutralized now

00:09:27.233 --> 00:09:28.467
because he denied Trump

00:09:28.467 --> 00:09:29.602
a potentially helpful.

00:09:29.602 --> 00:09:31.070
What exactly it takes.

00:09:31.070 --> 00:09:31.971
Allen Weisselberg

00:09:31.971 --> 00:09:32.872
off the table

00:09:32.872 --> 00:09:34.607
as a potential defense witness.

00:09:34.607 --> 00:09:35.441
Like I said before,

00:09:35.441 --> 00:09:37.043
you're not calling him as a prosecutor.

00:09:37.043 --> 00:09:37.743
The guy's

00:09:37.743 --> 00:09:39.345
going to have at least one conviction

00:09:39.345 --> 00:09:40.713
